abstract: "Seeded benchmark and evaluation protocol for cloud cost anomaly detection and candidate-event attribution on FOCUS billing data, with events derived from the Alibaba GPU cluster trace: benchmark builder, two-direction time-block calibration protocol with matched controls, rule-based and Isolation Forest detectors, attribution baselines, results, and a prototype dashboard."

